    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.13,
      117.22,
      316.68,
      141.46
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.13,
      155.02,
      316.65,
      178.36
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Land Development (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.13,
      191.02,
      316.67,
      226.36
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 48A of the principal enactment is hereby amended by the repeal of the words \u201cor upon his or her marriage\u201d in subsection 48A 2(c).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.13,
      251.02,
      316.66,
      274.36
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 48B of the principal enactment is hereby amended by the repeal of subsection 48B 1(a).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.13,
      311.02,
      316.65,
      358.36
    ],
    "text": "4. Section 68 of the principal enactment is hereby amended in subsection (1) of that section by the substitution for the words \u201cfails to succeed\u201d of the words \u201cfails without reasonable cause to succeed\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.13,
      371.02,
      316.65,
      418.36
    ],
    "text": "5. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
